From: =?UTF-8?q?C=C3=BCneyt=20=C4=B0nan?= <cuneytinan37@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 14:56:58 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] opponentHasInsufficientMaterial: also when Mateless
 proves the opponent can never mate

When a flag falls, lila draws the game if
position.opponentHasInsufficientMaterial. #821 added a one-move
lookahead; this adds Mateless's ladder (opponentCanNeverMate): the
material test, the lock detector and a 6-ply helpmate search. Standard
and From Position only, and not in a position without legal moves.

On 192,457 Lichess timeouts up to August 2026 that were scored as wins
though the flagged side could never be mated (chasolver's data):
scalachess draws 136,913 today, 192,421 with this; 36 stay unproven.
The 55,508 new draws are blocked pawn structures (50,829) and deeper
forced lines (4,679). Cost: about 0.9 microseconds per verdict, against
0.6 today; it runs only when a flag falls.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CNt12HAZEwEiCouRmksRvj
---
 core/src/main/scala/Position.scala | 10 +++++++++-
 1 file changed, 9 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/core/src/main/scala/Position.scala b/core/src/main/scala/Position.scala
index f029ae1..0c11619 100644
--- a/core/src/main/scala/Position.scala
+++ b/core/src/main/scala/Position.scala
@@ -99,7 +99,15 @@ case class Position(board: Board, history: History, variant: Variant, color: Col
                 newPos.staleMate
             )
           }
-      )
+      ) || opponentCanNeverMate
+
+  /** The opponent can never mate, by Mateless's ladder (chess.mateless): the material test, the lock
+    * detector (pawns, kings and bishops that no series of legal moves can open) and a short helpmate
+    * search. Standard rules only; not in a position without legal moves (the game is over).
+    */
+  def opponentCanNeverMate: Boolean =
+    (variant.standard || variant.fromPosition) && legalMoves.nonEmpty &&
+      mateless.Ladder.opponentCannotMate(mateless.Domino(), this, color)
 
   inline def playerHasInsufficientMaterial: Boolean = variant.playerHasInsufficientMaterial(this)
 
